# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Only the real routes are rewritten. A catch-all `/* /index.html 200` would
# return the homepage at HTTP 200 for every unknown URL, which is a soft 404:
# search engines index it and the status lies. Anything not listed here falls
# through to 404.html, which these hosts serve with a real 404 status.

/           /index.html   200
/about      /index.html   200
/contact    /index.html   200
/faq        /index.html   200
/sign-up    /index.html   200
/thank-you  /index.html   200
/risk-disclosure  /index.html   200
/privacy    /index.html   200
/terms      /index.html   200
/cookie-policy    /index.html   200
